  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI) - PDL Women Craft Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our primary products will include handmade fabrics specially designed and produced by women, hand painted T shirts and throw pillows, fabric wall plaques, fabrics, digital fabric design, arts and craft. , Our primary purpose is to train and empower women with self-sustainable design skills so that they can be financial empowered to contribute to the total wellbeing of their family. , The finished product will be sold to fashion and textile designers in Nigeria who are constantly searching for bespoke fabrics that will make their work distinct. The price (or is it the cost) of the finished product will range between $10 and $40 depending on the type of design.,</narrative>
  </description>
